    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Occupational exposure to ionizing radiation over decades of radium research and X-ray work: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Chronic radiodermatitis of the fingertips, with thin, scarred skin: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

